(Bcde fg^ab) (c'b^ag fedc) | (defg ^abc'd') (e'd'c'b ^agfe) |
(defg ^abc'd') (c'b^ag fedc) | (Bcde fg^ab) (^agfe dcB^A) |
(G^ABc defg) (fedc B^AGF) | (EFG^A Bcde) (dcB^A GFE2) |]

